# Cline entry point
# The authoritative instructions live in AGENTS.md — read it in full.

Before doing anything on a new task:

1. Read `AGENTS.md` (working rules for this repository).
2. Read `docs/plan.md`, `docs/architecture.md` and `docs/progress.md`.
3. Follow the Definition of Done in `AGENTS.md` §6 and keep `docs/progress.md`
   up to date after every task.

Do not duplicate the rules here; edit `AGENTS.md` instead.
